    "name": "Eurostars Porto Centro",
    "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Luxurious Accommodation</strong><br>Eurostars Porto Centro offers air-conditioned rooms with modern amenities like flat-screen TVs and complimentary toiletries. The perfect retreat after a day of exploring Porto.</p><p><strong>Convenient Location</strong><br>Situated just 300 meters from Paris Galleries Street, guests can easily access popular attractions such as City Market Bolhao and Oporto Coliseum, both within 400 meters from the hotel.</p><p><strong>Exceptional Service</strong><br>Enjoy the convenience of free WiFi throughout the property and a 24-hour front desk ready to assist you at any time during your stay.</p><p>Experience comfort and convenience at Eurostars Porto Centro. Book your stay now!</p>",
